    "created_at": "2015-09-09T10:00:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-09T10:00:19Z",
    "body": "Is that the same set of elements on which `offsetTop` and friends make sense? There's a bug that these are supported for SVG in Blink, and I suspect that the elements where they might actually work are the same as those we're discussing here.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
