    "created_at": "2015-09-09T22:36:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-09T22:36:32Z",
    "body": "It seems no. According to [the CSSOM View spec](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#extensions-to-the-htmlelement-interface), `offsetTop` is an attribute of `HTMLElement`. While according to [the SVG 1.1 spec](http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/struct.html#InterfaceSVGSVGElement) the outer `<svg>` is an `SVGElement`.\n",
